        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion T9, Rustic Ahwahnee Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ahwahnee Deadbolt has a rustic look that makes it perfect for traditional homes. As part of Fusion's American Relic Collection, it draws upon historic designs and translates them into the modern design aesthetic. The Ahwahnee Door Lock is available in both single and double cylinder functions. Choose from antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion T9 Ahwahnee Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for American Relic Collection Ahwahnee Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
